@startuml
actor Buyer
participant Browser
participant AuthFilter
participant ApiServlet
participant OrderService
participant MarketplaceDAO
participant HikariCP
 database H2
Buyer -> Browser: Click Place Order
Browser -> ApiServlet: POST /api/v1/orders + session cookie
ApiServlet -> AuthFilter: session/role validation
AuthFilter --> ApiServlet: authenticated Buyer
ApiServlet -> OrderService: checkout(buyerId)
OrderService -> MarketplaceDAO: read cart and stock
MarketplaceDAO -> HikariCP: getConnection()
HikariCP -> H2: SELECT cart/products
H2 --> MarketplaceDAO: cart lines and stock
MarketplaceDAO -> H2: INSERT order/order_items; decrement stock; clear cart
MarketplaceDAO -> H2: COMMIT transaction
MarketplaceDAO --> OrderService: orderId
OrderService --> ApiServlet: mock confirmation DTO
ApiServlet --> Browser: 201 JSON envelope
Browser --> Buyer: Show order confirmation
@enduml
